  "description": "Spacious one bed apartment presented in pristine condition throughout located in the Mespil Estate off Sussex Terrace in Donnybrook. Freshly painted throughout this property is fully furnished and benefits from gas central heating , wood floors and ample storage. Resident parking is available at €50.00 per calendar year and there are extensive gardens maintained for residents use. There is also a swimming pool located in development (local charges apply).  \n\nLocated on Sussex Terrace , 103 Cedar House enjoys a prime location just a short stroll from Fitzwilliam Square and Stephens Green. Many of Dublins leading employers , hospitals and universities are within walking distance or just a short commute away. Residents benefit from easy access to both Donnybrook and Ranelagh Villages with an excellent selection of  amenities including cafes, restaurants, supermarkets and leisure facilities.  \nExcellent public transport links are nearby by including bus, Dart and LUAS light rail. \n   ",
